WEBVTT

01:55.640 --> 01:58.229
His Majesty has arrived.

01:59.590 --> 02:01.200
Your Majesty, you're late.

02:04.870 --> 02:06.280
I was busy checking

02:06.480 --> 02:08.000
the treasury ledger you gave me.

02:08.000 --> 02:09.840
There were too many accounting records.

02:09.840 --> 02:11.000
I haven't finished checking them today.

02:11.000 --> 02:11.710
That's why

02:11.960 --> 02:12.870
I'm late.

02:15.680 --> 02:16.540
Your Highness.

02:18.079 --> 02:20.140
Xiao Chi has been keeping me company.

02:20.150 --> 02:21.400
We all

02:22.030 --> 02:23.870
grew up under your watchful eye.

02:24.750 --> 02:27.400
So, I brought him along.

02:29.240 --> 02:30.240
Good.

02:30.840 --> 02:33.170
It's been a while since we drank together.

02:34.280 --> 02:35.940
A toast to Your Majesty first.

02:36.470 --> 02:37.520
I haven't

02:37.910 --> 02:39.280
shared a drink with you

02:39.280 --> 02:40.740
in a long time either, Xie.

02:41.470 --> 02:41.870
Then,

02:41.870 --> 02:43.079
today can be considered a family reunion

02:43.079 --> 02:44.680
for us.

02:45.430 --> 02:46.240
Let me

02:47.000 --> 02:48.460
toast to our father first.

03:04.280 --> 03:05.150
What?

03:06.030 --> 03:08.030
Are you afraid that I'll poison you?

03:09.030 --> 03:10.000
Of course, not.

03:10.630 --> 03:11.870
Let us

03:12.030 --> 03:13.490
share this bottle of wine.

03:13.630 --> 03:14.190
Okay.

03:15.150 --> 03:16.030
Then,

03:16.630 --> 03:18.150
thank you, Xie.

03:26.280 --> 03:27.190
This is

03:27.840 --> 03:29.560
to our Liu Empire.

03:30.240 --> 03:31.280
To our

03:32.079 --> 03:33.470
sibling bond.

03:46.190 --> 03:47.190
Your Highness.

03:47.280 --> 03:48.410
Don't wait anymore.

03:48.470 --> 03:51.670
His Majesty went to
the Eldest Princess' palace tonight.

03:53.280 --> 03:54.810
I didn't expect him to come.

03:57.430 --> 03:59.430
I just have a bad premonition.

04:00.840 --> 04:03.030
Xie, you asked me here

04:03.030 --> 04:04.590
for more than just drinking, right?

04:04.590 --> 04:05.400
What else?

04:06.280 --> 04:08.210
You are usually straightforward.

04:08.470 --> 04:09.630
Why do you seem

04:10.590 --> 04:11.840
strange today?

04:14.960 --> 04:16.070
Since then,

04:16.430 --> 04:18.000
I will be frank.

04:19.800 --> 04:20.630
Liu Chu.

04:22.070 --> 04:23.750
You murdered important ministers,

04:23.750 --> 04:25.160
destabilizing the court,

04:25.160 --> 04:26.600
bringing down a toxic plague,

04:26.600 --> 04:28.260
and making the people suffer.

04:28.360 --> 04:29.600
You held a grand marriage
alliance ceremony

04:29.600 --> 04:30.800
that emptied the treasury.

04:30.800 --> 04:33.530
You have accomplished
nothing in state affairs.

04:33.600 --> 04:35.860
You are not fit to be
the ruler of Jinglan.

04:35.870 --> 04:37.000
I'm not fit?

04:37.630 --> 04:38.430
Xie.

04:38.800 --> 04:40.390
I am our father's only son.

04:40.390 --> 04:41.270
If I'm not fit,

04:42.480 --> 04:43.310
are you?

04:44.040 --> 04:44.920
A son?

04:45.560 --> 04:47.430
If I were the ruler,

04:48.000 --> 04:50.070
I would expand the territory

04:50.360 --> 04:52.159
and let the people live in peace.

04:52.240 --> 04:54.190
Women are not inferior to men.

05:00.190 --> 05:02.390
If you took the throne,

05:03.070 --> 05:04.430
after you pass away,

05:05.270 --> 05:07.360
who would you pass it to?

05:08.160 --> 05:09.070
To an outsider?

05:09.070 --> 05:10.270
Don't worry about that.

05:10.270 --> 05:12.240
I will let Consort Ling's child

05:12.240 --> 05:13.370
inherit the throne.

05:13.830 --> 05:16.870
This empire will always
belong to the Liu Family.

05:17.070 --> 05:19.190
Then, how do you plan to deal with me?

05:20.160 --> 05:21.270
I hope

05:22.190 --> 05:24.360
you can stay
in the Princess's Mansion.

05:24.360 --> 05:25.960
Eat and drink well every day.

05:26.270 --> 05:28.040
I will provide for you until you die.

05:28.040 --> 05:29.480
I think this is

05:29.480 --> 05:31.140
the best choice for both of us.

05:32.270 --> 05:33.190
But what if

05:34.560 --> 05:35.600
I refuse?

05:36.360 --> 05:37.190
You

05:37.480 --> 05:38.600
have to.

05:42.040 --> 05:43.360
Xie,

05:43.870 --> 05:45.390
this is treason.

05:46.950 --> 05:48.190
You forced me.

05:48.870 --> 05:50.040
Guards!

05:54.159 --> 05:54.960
Your Majesty!

06:21.630 --> 06:23.160
Surrender now.

06:24.160 --> 06:26.240
Then, you and Xiao Chi can survive.

06:26.360 --> 06:27.040
Think about

06:27.040 --> 06:29.040
your so-called good brothers.

06:51.270 --> 06:52.190
Fei Zheng?

06:52.560 --> 06:53.390
I didn't expect your swordsmanship

06:53.390 --> 06:54.600
to be so excellent.

06:55.000 --> 06:56.070
Greetings, Your Highness.

06:56.070 --> 06:57.390
Now, you three brothers

06:57.390 --> 06:58.480
are all here.

06:58.830 --> 06:59.480
Kill them!

07:12.950 --> 07:13.750
Stop!

07:14.240 --> 07:15.360
The Eldest Princess of the royal family

07:15.360 --> 07:16.890
cannot be killed so easily.

07:17.950 --> 07:18.800
It is not

07:20.240 --> 07:21.680
the time to kill her.

07:30.600 --> 07:32.950
Eldest Princess Liu Xie

07:33.159 --> 07:35.000
has secretly formed cliques

07:35.000 --> 07:36.830
and plotted treason.

07:36.870 --> 07:39.070
I feel heartbroken about that.

07:39.360 --> 07:40.070
Today,

07:40.390 --> 07:42.070
I'll strip her of her title

07:42.070 --> 07:44.240
and confine her to the Princess's Mansion.

07:44.240 --> 07:46.560
She shall not leave unless in death.

07:46.830 --> 07:48.830
By Imperial Command.

08:03.560 --> 08:04.480
Guards!

08:17.680 --> 08:18.830
Guards!

08:39.270 --> 08:40.750
Come to see me!

08:42.840 --> 08:43.960
Liu Chu!

08:44.390 --> 08:45.480
You coward!

08:45.550 --> 08:47.080
Are you afraid to see me?

08:48.550 --> 08:49.840
Liu Chu!

09:04.030 --> 09:04.910
Father,

09:05.360 --> 09:08.440
why are you doing this to me?

09:19.080 --> 09:20.790
Zheng knows martial arts?

09:21.390 --> 09:23.440
And he used Changmo's swordplay?

09:37.270 --> 09:38.870
How could you be so careless?

09:40.390 --> 09:41.190
It's nothing.

09:48.480 --> 09:49.940
Something's on your mind.

09:51.480 --> 09:53.000
I just feel that

09:53.510 --> 09:54.910
people are complicated,

09:55.480 --> 09:56.880
and human nature is cold.

09:57.480 --> 09:58.150
But

09:58.150 --> 10:00.150
no matter how things change,

10:00.750 --> 10:03.210
we've been through
life and death together.

10:03.840 --> 10:04.630
Yeah.

10:05.600 --> 10:07.750
We've been through
life and death together.

10:07.750 --> 10:08.600
After all,

10:10.080 --> 10:12.140
we've experienced so much together.

10:13.150 --> 10:14.080
How about

10:14.080 --> 10:15.270
I have a drink with you?

10:15.270 --> 10:16.480
Then,

10:16.840 --> 10:18.150
I'll suffer a lot.

10:18.480 --> 10:19.550
Don't worry.

10:20.200 --> 10:21.480
I have a hangover cure.

10:22.200 --> 10:23.200
But your hangover cure...

10:23.200 --> 10:24.460
I changed its formula.

10:52.270 --> 10:53.510
In the past,

10:54.270 --> 10:55.750
I liked this place the most.

10:55.750 --> 10:56.810
I enjoyed drinking

10:57.360 --> 10:58.560
and moon gazing here.

10:59.550 --> 11:00.880
It has a special flavor.

11:03.670 --> 11:04.480
I know.

11:05.550 --> 11:07.000
Occasional freedom

11:07.240 --> 11:08.240
can make us briefly

11:08.240 --> 11:10.000
forget earthly troubles.

11:11.670 --> 11:13.270
I really like it here too,

11:13.870 --> 11:16.150
but drinking on the dunes in Changmo

11:16.240 --> 11:17.840
would be even more freeing.

11:20.390 --> 11:22.250
If we can return to Tianlang Pass,

11:22.750 --> 11:24.080
you'd share a pot of wine with me

11:24.080 --> 11:25.630
on the dunes.

11:26.750 --> 11:27.870
Don't worry.

11:28.790 --> 11:30.920
I'm just afraid you can't outdrink me.

11:31.630 --> 11:32.830
I can't outdrink you?

11:39.670 --> 11:40.720
Sometimes,

11:41.270 --> 11:43.240
I really want to go back to our childhood.

11:43.240 --> 11:44.240
Back then,

11:45.200 --> 11:46.150
Chu,

11:46.910 --> 11:47.670
Zheng,

11:50.080 --> 11:51.510
and I were the closest ones

11:51.510 --> 11:52.960
in this world.

11:54.750 --> 11:56.150
Back then, I thought that

11:57.000 --> 11:59.800
we would be good brothers
for the rest of our lives.

12:00.240 --> 12:01.600
His Majesty

12:01.600 --> 12:03.000
still treats you very well now.

12:03.000 --> 12:04.200
And so does Lord Fei.

12:06.200 --> 12:06.840
Yes.

12:07.360 --> 12:08.840
They do treat me well.

12:11.480 --> 12:12.480
They always have.

12:15.200 --> 12:16.080
But now,

12:17.080 --> 12:18.480
everything has changed.

12:21.360 --> 12:23.840
Power can change many people and things.

12:24.030 --> 12:26.670
But some relationships will never change.

12:33.600 --> 12:35.440
I plan to ask Chu for permission

12:35.870 --> 12:38.000
to go back and guard the Tianlang Pass.

12:39.240 --> 12:41.040
The conditions there are harsh,

12:41.080 --> 12:43.280
but at least there are no distractions.

12:47.200 --> 12:48.660
Do you want to come with me?

12:49.000 --> 12:50.080
Did you think I couldn't bear to leave

12:50.080 --> 12:51.680
the medical hall you gave me?

12:51.840 --> 12:52.840
Tell you the truth.

12:52.840 --> 12:54.670
I've wanted to go back for a long time.

12:54.670 --> 12:55.480
Really?

12:55.960 --> 12:57.160
Why would I lie to you?

12:57.550 --> 12:58.360
Okay.

13:02.150 --> 13:03.810
I've been carrying this pouch

13:03.840 --> 13:05.240
with me all the time.

13:07.750 --> 13:08.670
Though

13:10.360 --> 13:11.760
this is a gift you gave me,

13:12.600 --> 13:13.600
today,

13:14.320 --> 13:15.580
I want to give it to you.

13:16.480 --> 13:18.740
Let's go back to Tianlang Pass together.

13:19.840 --> 13:20.960
You promised me.

13:26.200 --> 13:27.260
Yes, I promise you.

13:29.440 --> 13:30.000
Okay.

13:38.150 --> 13:40.390
My mission is almost done.

13:41.750 --> 13:43.750
I will depart for Changmo tomorrow.

13:44.670 --> 13:45.390
Then,

13:45.600 --> 13:48.060
who will assign missions
to Fei Zheng and me?

13:48.390 --> 13:49.120
Let Fei Zheng

13:52.120 --> 13:54.000
fend for himself.

13:55.080 --> 13:55.840
Then,

13:56.080 --> 13:56.880
what about me?

13:58.550 --> 14:00.120
Didn't the Princess ask you to
return to the palace

14:00.120 --> 14:01.360
and stay by her side?

14:01.480 --> 14:03.240
Anyway, Liu Xie is already
under house arrest.

14:03.240 --> 14:04.080
You can go back

14:04.080 --> 14:06.080
and continue waiting for my return.

14:07.030 --> 14:08.600
What about the Gu poison in my body?

14:08.600 --> 14:09.550
Don't worry.

14:09.840 --> 14:11.700
I will leave you enough antidote.

14:16.270 --> 14:16.910
Remember,

14:17.320 --> 14:18.600
you will always be

14:18.600 --> 14:20.240
a killing tool of Caidie Hall.

14:20.240 --> 14:22.630
You can never escape the grasp of Changmo.

15:26.480 --> 15:27.670
This body is

15:29.240 --> 15:31.240
getting weaker.

15:50.030 --> 15:51.000
Jin Xi.

15:51.750 --> 15:53.550
Jin Xi.

15:59.120 --> 16:01.450
Jin Xi hasn't come to see
me for a long time.

16:12.790 --> 16:13.650
Your Highness,

16:14.150 --> 16:15.410
are you looking for me?

16:16.480 --> 16:17.440
Jin Xi.

16:23.000 --> 16:24.000
Jin Xi,

16:24.390 --> 16:25.630
it is you.

16:25.630 --> 16:26.150
Yes.

16:29.080 --> 16:31.000
You came to the palace to keep me company.

16:31.000 --> 16:31.440
Yes,

16:31.670 --> 16:33.400
I came back to keep you company.

16:33.870 --> 16:35.270
And you will never leave?

16:36.000 --> 16:36.800
I won't leave.

16:38.790 --> 16:40.550
Talk with me more.

16:40.960 --> 16:41.870
Without you,

16:42.150 --> 16:43.870
I have nothing to say to them.

16:45.150 --> 16:46.240
What's up?

16:47.150 --> 16:48.150
Now that I'm back,

16:48.200 --> 16:49.390
are you not happy?

16:50.080 --> 16:52.390
I am happy.

16:55.080 --> 16:56.480
Will the Eldest Princess

16:56.550 --> 16:58.030
let you stay here?

17:01.240 --> 17:02.700
Liu Xie intended to rebel.

17:03.030 --> 17:04.109
She has been grounded by Liu Chu

17:04.109 --> 17:05.440
in the Princess Palace.

17:06.030 --> 17:07.069
How could she?

17:07.349 --> 17:08.550
The assassins she trained,

17:08.550 --> 17:10.000
and Lan by her side

17:10.000 --> 17:10.880
are all dead.

17:11.270 --> 17:12.000
Otherwise,

17:12.200 --> 17:13.270
I wouldn't have been able to

17:13.270 --> 17:14.730
return to you so smoothly.

17:16.880 --> 17:18.940
How could the Eldest Princess rebel?

17:19.160 --> 17:20.550
I must go see her.

17:22.680 --> 17:24.880
Don't do it right now.

17:25.000 --> 17:26.750
We are unable to figure out

17:26.880 --> 17:29.030
the matters between Liu Xie and Liu Chu.

17:29.030 --> 17:30.830
But when I came to Jinglan,

17:31.960 --> 17:33.350
she was so nice to me.

17:35.750 --> 17:37.680
If she were truly kind to you,

17:38.240 --> 17:39.960
she wouldn't have

17:39.960 --> 17:42.960
confined you to your quarters
when Liu Chu was in a coma.

17:42.960 --> 17:43.720
Besides,

17:44.310 --> 17:46.350
she wanted to kill her own brother.

17:47.000 --> 17:48.730
How could she be sincere to you?

17:50.590 --> 17:52.070
Is she really that bad?

17:52.070 --> 17:53.400
Whether she's good or bad

17:53.400 --> 17:55.260
has nothing to do with us anymore.

17:55.790 --> 17:56.590
By the way,

17:57.000 --> 17:58.070
how is Liu Chu

17:58.830 --> 18:00.200
treating you now?

18:03.750 --> 18:05.400
Liu Chu has changed, too.

18:08.030 --> 18:10.000
I really hope the next plan

18:10.000 --> 18:11.400
can be implemented soon.

18:12.440 --> 18:13.680
What plan?

18:15.400 --> 18:16.240
Nothing.

18:17.640 --> 18:19.750
Look at your big belly.

18:20.400 --> 18:21.680
If I were Liu Chu,

18:21.680 --> 18:23.540
I wouldn't come to see you either.

18:23.640 --> 18:25.170
What are you talking about?

18:26.030 --> 18:27.830
I am pregnant with his child.

18:29.160 --> 18:30.160
Okay. Okay. Okay.

18:30.310 --> 18:31.480
I was just kidding.

18:32.030 --> 18:33.880
Liu Chu just recovered from his illness

18:33.880 --> 18:36.240
and encountered
the Eldest Princess's rebellion,

18:36.240 --> 18:38.970
it's understandable that
he hasn't visited you.

18:41.830 --> 18:42.680
Your Majesty.

18:43.030 --> 18:44.110
Two of the three Chief Ministers of

18:44.110 --> 18:46.030
Jinglan have died.

18:46.480 --> 18:48.350
And the other one has been infected
with Gu poison.

18:48.350 --> 18:49.680
Eldest Princess Liu Xie

18:49.680 --> 18:50.790
was imprisoned by Liu Chu

18:50.790 --> 18:52.030
for rebelling.

18:52.480 --> 18:53.790
What about the spies we sent?

18:53.790 --> 18:55.350
Jin Xi has returned to the Princess

18:55.350 --> 18:57.010
to continue spying on Liu Chu.

18:58.160 --> 18:59.200
Fei Zheng

18:59.200 --> 19:00.680
was poisoned by Gu poison

19:01.200 --> 19:02.200
at my mercy.

19:10.160 --> 19:11.240
Your health...

19:13.400 --> 19:14.830
I am fine.

19:15.000 --> 19:16.160
I feel great.

19:16.240 --> 19:17.830
I will live to see the day

19:17.830 --> 19:19.550
we defeat Jinglan

19:19.550 --> 19:21.270
and capture Liu Chu.

19:23.830 --> 19:25.830
Gan Yi is training the troops every day.

19:25.830 --> 19:27.430
The army is ready for battle.

19:27.880 --> 19:29.410
You are wise, Your majesty.

19:29.480 --> 19:30.440
Where is Han Lie?

19:31.640 --> 19:33.590
He is developing a new Gu poison.

19:33.960 --> 19:36.200
It will be spread all over Jinglan.

19:40.590 --> 19:41.590
Good.

19:42.000 --> 19:43.640
Excellent.

19:53.160 --> 19:55.070
His Majesty has arrived.

19:55.070 --> 19:57.880
Your Highness, receive His Majesty.

20:10.270 --> 20:11.070
Coward.

20:12.590 --> 20:14.350
What's the point of locking me up here?

20:14.350 --> 20:15.640
If you want to kill me,

20:16.160 --> 20:17.160
make it quick.

20:17.350 --> 20:18.240
Xie.

20:18.640 --> 20:19.920
Everyone says

20:20.680 --> 20:22.280
we are the closest siblings.

20:22.750 --> 20:24.000
If I kill you,

20:24.830 --> 20:26.430
they will call me heartless.

20:28.680 --> 20:29.590
Closest?

20:30.400 --> 20:32.110
How long ago was that?

20:32.590 --> 20:34.850
You were the late Emperor's first child.

20:35.160 --> 20:36.030
Our father

20:37.440 --> 20:39.160
raised you as an emperor.

20:39.440 --> 20:40.880
You mastered

20:40.880 --> 20:41.880
both literary

20:41.880 --> 20:43.080
and military skills.

20:43.790 --> 20:45.000
In reading people

20:45.000 --> 20:46.060
and managing them,

20:46.270 --> 20:47.870
you were also superior to me.

20:48.880 --> 20:49.790
I admit it.

20:50.240 --> 20:52.840
You were the child our father
was most proud of.

20:53.400 --> 20:54.480
If you were a man,

20:55.160 --> 20:57.820
I would have had no chance
to succeed the throne.

21:08.070 --> 21:09.030
Father.

21:10.350 --> 21:11.590
Father.

21:13.070 --> 21:15.790
Why did you teach me the art of ruling?

21:16.590 --> 21:19.190
Why did you give me
the abilities of an emperor?

21:20.200 --> 21:21.750
Why didn't you raise me

21:21.750 --> 21:23.680
like an ordinary princess?

21:26.790 --> 21:29.350
Why did you treat me like this?

21:30.750 --> 21:32.200
Why on earth?

21:32.200 --> 21:33.640
Why?

21:34.350 --> 21:36.030
This may be our fate.

21:37.030 --> 21:38.070
Xie.

21:38.680 --> 21:39.270
Fate?

21:40.400 --> 21:41.640
I am the Eldest Princess.

21:41.640 --> 21:42.880
My fate should be

21:42.880 --> 21:44.030
in my own hands.

21:44.400 --> 21:45.590
What are you?

21:45.590 --> 21:47.270
Do you even deserve to be an emperor?

21:47.270 --> 21:48.670
Can you manage the court?

21:49.160 --> 21:50.750
Can you defend against foreign enemies?

21:50.750 --> 21:52.480
Can you control the officials?

21:53.680 --> 21:54.550
I am telling you,

21:54.550 --> 21:55.640
Jinglan

21:55.960 --> 21:58.220
will be destroyed by you sooner or later.

22:00.240 --> 22:01.550
Rest assured, Xie.

22:04.750 --> 22:05.950
Drink this cup of wine

22:07.030 --> 22:09.160
and watch over me from heaven.

22:10.350 --> 22:11.680
For everything you worry about

22:11.680 --> 22:12.680
and doubt,

22:13.350 --> 22:14.880
I will prove to you one by one
that I am right.

22:14.880 --> 22:15.610
What's more,

22:16.400 --> 22:18.530
I will deal with everything very well.

22:27.510 --> 22:28.590
After I drink it,

22:30.880 --> 22:32.680
you can announce

22:35.000 --> 22:36.350
that I died of illness.

22:37.960 --> 22:40.090
I will use the highest imperial honors

22:41.160 --> 22:43.270
to give you a grand burial.

22:44.550 --> 22:45.440
To me,

22:46.200 --> 22:48.350
you will always be like our mother,

22:49.960 --> 22:50.880
Xie.

23:12.480 --> 23:13.480
Liu Chu.

23:14.350 --> 23:15.480
I hope

23:17.000 --> 23:19.160
you can keep your word.

23:52.400 --> 23:53.200
Father,

23:56.750 --> 23:57.550
I am coming.

24:22.590 --> 24:23.590
Oh, you.

24:24.310 --> 24:25.640
You are the emperor now,

24:25.680 --> 24:27.350
but you still let me do this for you?

24:27.350 --> 24:28.960
I can't trust anyone else.

24:29.350 --> 24:30.200
Besides,

24:30.440 --> 24:31.310
no one has

24:31.310 --> 24:32.750
skills as good as yours.

24:32.790 --> 24:33.680
Okay.

24:34.000 --> 24:35.830
Just lie here quietly

24:35.880 --> 24:37.010
and don't bother me.

24:39.240 --> 24:40.830
I will always be with you

24:41.070 --> 24:42.550
and assist you.

24:43.030 --> 24:44.070
I believe

24:44.350 --> 24:46.750
you will definitely revitalize the court,

24:47.270 --> 24:48.930
bring honor to the Liu family,

24:49.640 --> 24:51.440
and restore our father's glory.

24:52.030 --> 24:56.240
By the mandate of Heaven,
the Emperor decrees:

24:56.510 --> 24:58.640
the Eldest Princess, Liu Xie,

24:58.960 --> 25:00.790
contracted a severe illness

25:00.790 --> 25:02.790
and passed away suddenly.

25:03.310 --> 25:05.750
As my flesh and blood,

25:06.270 --> 25:09.640
she will be buried with imperial honors.

25:09.920 --> 25:11.880
Her coffin will be kept for seven days

25:11.880 --> 25:17.000
before burial in the imperial
mausoleum. By Imperial Command.

25:19.400 --> 25:21.480
Just bless me well from heaven.

25:22.030 --> 25:24.400
All your worries and doubts,

25:24.640 --> 25:26.160
I will show you one by one.

25:26.160 --> 25:26.890
What's more,

25:27.270 --> 25:28.750
I will do it very well.

25:43.440 --> 25:45.750
Why did you ask me to meet you
during the day?

25:45.750 --> 25:46.510
Don't worry.

25:47.070 --> 25:47.930
I'm the only one

25:48.590 --> 25:49.790
who will come here.

25:50.680 --> 25:52.000
No one else will see us.

25:52.750 --> 25:54.270
She temporarily went back to Changmo

25:54.270 --> 25:55.880
and didn't leave the antidote.

25:55.880 --> 25:57.510
So, your Gu poison might...

25:58.640 --> 26:00.030
That's good.

26:00.350 --> 26:02.830
Rather than being a killing tool,

26:04.270 --> 26:06.070
it's better to die a quick death.

26:08.480 --> 26:10.410
Are you really not afraid of death?

26:10.640 --> 26:11.440
Death?

26:15.750 --> 26:16.960
As spies,

26:17.270 --> 26:18.350
shouldn't we have

26:18.350 --> 26:20.350
put life aside long ago?

26:24.480 --> 26:25.270
Have a seat.

26:31.350 --> 26:32.810
Before coming to Jinglan,

26:33.030 --> 26:34.090
I was just like you.

26:34.880 --> 26:35.720
I thought

26:35.720 --> 26:36.880
that dying for Changmo

26:36.880 --> 26:38.410
was a very honorable thing.

26:39.350 --> 26:40.720
At that time, I only cared about

26:40.720 --> 26:42.790
the missions assigned by Changmo.

26:43.880 --> 26:46.010
I remember the first time I saw Liu Chu.

26:46.480 --> 26:48.400
I wanted to kill him right away.

26:50.200 --> 26:51.240
Unfortunately,

26:52.000 --> 26:54.640
my mission at that time
was to stay in the Prince's Mansion

26:54.640 --> 26:55.770
and stay by his side.

27:00.400 --> 27:02.960
Later, Xiao Chi also entered
the Prince's Mansion.

27:02.960 --> 27:05.960
They dragged me to mess around,

27:06.270 --> 27:08.670
turning the Prince's Mansion upside down.

27:09.030 --> 27:10.750
I thought they were very silly

27:11.270 --> 27:12.240
and childish.

27:23.480 --> 27:24.550
Then,

27:25.480 --> 27:26.480
somehow,

27:26.960 --> 27:28.400
I became like them,

27:29.350 --> 27:31.070
going behind the manager's back

27:31.070 --> 27:32.870
and sneaking out of the mansion.

27:33.640 --> 27:35.170
At that time, the three of us

27:36.030 --> 27:36.960
were teenagers

27:37.480 --> 27:40.010
and dared to fight for justice
on the streets.

27:40.240 --> 27:43.500
Every day, we were chased
and beaten by dozens of ruffians.

27:44.030 --> 27:45.160
Once

27:45.310 --> 27:46.640
we got into big trouble,

27:47.200 --> 27:49.130
I took a beating for the two of them.

27:49.270 --> 27:50.880
They cried right next to me.

27:54.240 --> 27:55.300
Hearing their cry,

28:05.030 --> 28:05.960
for the first time in my life,

28:05.960 --> 28:07.830
I felt a warmth in my heart.

28:15.440 --> 28:16.240
Jin Xi,

28:18.400 --> 28:20.860
if someone is willing
to take risks with you,

28:22.030 --> 28:23.200
get into trouble,

28:23.680 --> 28:25.140
and take responsibility,

28:27.110 --> 28:28.790
it's a happy thing.

28:41.880 --> 28:42.640
I really hope

28:43.880 --> 28:45.680
you'll feel the same way I do.

29:21.030 --> 29:22.000
Greetings, Your Majesty.

29:22.000 --> 29:23.000
You are pregnant.

29:23.640 --> 29:24.900
There is no need to bow.

29:25.240 --> 29:26.640
I had nothing to do,

29:26.680 --> 29:28.030
so I came to see you.

29:29.350 --> 29:30.550
Consort Ling,

29:30.550 --> 29:31.880
are you homesick again?

29:33.750 --> 29:34.550
No.

29:35.640 --> 29:37.770
Changmo sent many tributes recently.

29:37.960 --> 29:38.920
If you miss home,

29:39.400 --> 29:40.800
open them and take a look.

29:40.960 --> 29:43.030
I will send you some more maids

29:43.350 --> 29:45.030
to keep you company.

29:47.310 --> 29:48.970
I have been a bit tired lately.

29:49.880 --> 29:51.880
And I don't have much time
to spend with you.

29:51.880 --> 29:52.510
Why don't

29:53.240 --> 29:53.750
you stay in

29:53.750 --> 29:55.810
the Consort Ling Pavilion I gave you?

29:56.350 --> 29:57.610
Don't come out for now.

29:58.000 --> 29:59.200
Take care of our baby.

30:03.030 --> 30:03.680
Go back.

30:06.640 --> 30:08.300
Be careful not to catch a cold.

30:15.550 --> 30:16.240
Guards!

30:16.720 --> 30:17.440
Yes.

30:19.640 --> 30:21.640
Summon Fei Zheng and Xiao Chi
to see me.

30:21.640 --> 30:22.270
Also,

30:23.880 --> 30:26.070
tell the Imperial Guard
not to sleep tonight.

30:26.070 --> 30:27.730
Have them ready for my orders.

30:28.030 --> 30:29.000
Yes.

31:11.640 --> 31:12.480
Are you okay?

31:13.590 --> 31:14.270
Didn't I tell you

31:14.270 --> 31:16.000
not to come in without my order?

31:17.160 --> 31:17.960
His Majesty has issued a decree

31:17.960 --> 31:18.790
ordering you to enter the palace now.

31:18.790 --> 31:19.640
Got it.

31:20.030 --> 31:20.790
Get out.

31:21.160 --> 31:21.640
Yes.

31:51.270 --> 31:52.070
Your Majesty,

31:53.310 --> 31:54.200
I'm late.

31:55.640 --> 31:57.370
Apologies for making you wait.

31:57.830 --> 31:59.000
Xiao Chi and I

31:59.240 --> 32:00.770
have already started a pot.

32:00.880 --> 32:01.720
You

32:02.310 --> 32:03.270
should drink as a penalty.

32:03.270 --> 32:04.070
I

32:04.070 --> 32:05.270
will drink three cups as a penalty.

32:05.270 --> 32:06.470
Among the three of us,

32:06.480 --> 32:08.080
you have the best tolerance.

32:08.640 --> 32:10.030
Instead of three cups,

32:11.590 --> 32:12.790
how about three pots?

32:13.750 --> 32:14.310
I will

32:15.110 --> 32:16.770
obey Your Majesty's command.

32:18.480 --> 32:19.880
The three of us

32:19.880 --> 32:21.030
haven't seen

32:21.270 --> 32:23.240
much of each other over the years.

32:23.750 --> 32:24.790
Tonight,

32:24.790 --> 32:26.030
we have such fine wine.

32:26.030 --> 32:27.090
How can we waste it?

32:27.200 --> 32:27.640
Come,

32:27.880 --> 32:28.940
let's have a toast.

32:30.750 --> 32:31.550
Well,

32:31.790 --> 32:32.390
Fei Zheng,

32:33.590 --> 32:34.960
you'd drink a whole pot.

32:40.680 --> 32:41.750
Look at my memory.

32:42.350 --> 32:43.680
The penalty is three pots.

32:43.680 --> 32:44.400
Three pots.

32:45.270 --> 32:47.200
Now that Zheng is so straightforward,

32:47.200 --> 32:48.660
I should keep him company.

32:49.030 --> 32:49.880
Are you sure?

32:51.350 --> 32:52.160
Of course.

32:55.720 --> 32:56.480
Good.

32:56.750 --> 32:57.810
Straightforward.

32:58.590 --> 32:59.590
Then let's drink.

33:00.160 --> 33:00.960
Today,

33:01.200 --> 33:02.550
let’s

33:02.550 --> 33:03.640
drink till we drop.
